[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Attacked</h2>
<i>"This the perfect time to panic!!"<br>
--Zen Aeron</i>  
<p>You have engaged two other clans in direct battle!  Unfortunatly your allies are also occupied in other battles.  You are alone and under heavy enemy fire!  Destroy these two clans and move for compleate victory.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
The war fires burn; so do the clans of Nimbus.  Only four clans remain in this war....  You just happen to be one of them.  Destroy the last three leaders of the last three clans to gain ultimate control!
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=~Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=~lFinal Battle,MissionBegin,tnron81

